{}	base	set14-DEM08	Often	Exchange frequency is variable, depending on the resources each Yuhup family has. Families with more manioc production tend to exchange less with the Macuna but they do it often for other products they do not have. In contrast, families with less or no manioc production have very frequent exchanges. \nAs for ceremonial exchanges, their frequency depends on the state in which social relations are among the Yuhup and the Macuna; if there have been tensions there are less ceremonial exchanges.	\N	353	353	57	\N	\N	2026-09-27 10:36:49.766157+02	2026-09-27 10:36:49.766157+02	t
