{}	base	set09-DLB03_DLB03-1	No	Descent group is relevant insofar as some extended families are traditionally landowners and others are not - giving them a rather different relationship to the means of production - and insofar as descent groups play an important role in local politics, and hence in the doling out of government jobs.\nInvolvement in work obviously differs depending on life stage; the elderly do less hard physical labour, and children under 18 are mostly in school, which limits the hours they can work.\nCommunities of practice: university graduates have a very different range of jobs open to them, typically outside the oasis.	\N	4147	4035	715	\N	\N	2026-09-27 10:36:49.766157+02	2026-09-27 10:36:49.766157+02	t
