{}	base	set32-DLC33	Some people	There is somewhat less evidence available regarding contact opportunities for people living in Karuk communities. In the northernmost extent of Karuk territory, the predominant language contact described is between Karuk and Shasta speakers, however the largest Karuk population centers were on the downriver end of Karuk territory, nearer to Yurok communities. There were also denser marital and ceremonial ties between Karuk communities and Yurok communities, making Yurok contact particularly important for Karuk speakers.	\N	6424	6267	1065	\N	\N	2026-09-27 10:36:49.766157+02	2026-09-27 10:36:49.766157+02	t
