9645	{"comment": "Arguably, the contemporary era has provided the most opportunities for interaction in the labour domain. Shared labour is likely to have characterised pre-colonial group dynamics (e.g. the production of material culture, subsistence labour), and to some extent these practices still continue alongside newer forms of labour made possible in larger urban communities \\u2013 in this case at Maningrida particularly where many Burarra and YM people live and work every day.", "start": 1960, "end": 2020}	base	DLB0bNset29	\N	\N	57	370	30	\N	2026-09-27 10:36:49.766157+02	2026-09-27 10:36:49.766157+02	t
